The Go rendering: an application whose iota groups are printed by fmt, index an
array of names, are converted to int, stand as an array length, are a type
argument, pass through an interface method, are a parameter of a method a
service registered with net/rpc declares, and type a variable a linkname
directive exposes, each naming its first and third member.

